Error [jet.LiteralOutsideRange]: `11` is outside `Severity`'s range 0..10
  --> tests/ui/range_type_head_literal_out_of_bounds.jet:6:21
    |
  6 |     sev :: Severity{11}
    |                     ^^
 Why: A range type only holds values inside its bounds; `11` can never be a `Severity`
 Fix: Use a value in `0..10`, or widen the type's range
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0135
